                    <div id="content">
                        

    <div class="cfedContent">
        
        <div class="cfedContent__body">
            
                <div class="cfedContent__text"><div class="header2023">
<div class="header2023-text-wrapper">
    <div class="header2023-text-block">
<span class="header2023-section">Office of the President</span>
<hr />
<h1 class="header2023-page">Speaking Engagements</h1>
    </div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
                        


        </div>
    </div>


    <div class="cfedContent">
        
        <div class="cfedContent__body">
            
                <div class="cfedContent__text">


<div class="submenu2023">
<a href="/utilities/about-us/office-of-the-president/office-of-the-president-home">Austan Goolsbee</a>
<a class="currentPage2023" href="/utilities/about-us/office-of-the-president/office-of-the-president-speaking">Speaking Engagements</a>

<a href="/utilities/about-us/office-of-the-president/office-of-the-president-media-appearances">Media Appearances</a>
<a href="/utilities/about-us/office-of-the-president/office-of-the-president-past">Past Presidents</a>

</div>
</div>
                        


        </div>
    </div>


    <div class="cfedContent">
        
        <div class="cfedContent__body">
            
                <div class="cfedContent__text">
<div class="cyan-section-header">2026</div>

<div class="cyan-publication"><a href="/publications/speeches/2026/sept-30-norc">Why Consumers and Economists See Different Economies</a>
        <p class="cyan-publication-date">September 30, 2026 </p>
        <p>On September 30, Austan Goolsbee, president and CEO of the Federal Reserve Bank of Chicago, will speak at the event, Why Consumers and Economists See Different Economies, a collaboration between the Chicago Fed and the research organization NORC at the University of Chicago. </p>
        </div>

<div class="cyan-publication"><a href="/publications/speeches/2026/sept-21-omfif">Monetary Policy in an Uncertain World</a>
        <p class="cyan-publication-date">September 21, 2026 </p>
        <p>Federal Reserve Bank of Chicago President and CEO Austan Goolsbee will speak at an Official Monetary and Financial Institutions Forum event in London on September 21 at 5:30 am CT.  The discussion, titled In Conversation with Austan Goolsbee: Monetary Policy in an Uncertain World, will be moderated by OMFIF Chairman David Marsh. </p>
        </div>




<div class="cyan-publication"><a href="/publications/speeches/2026/jul-14-kenosha-business-alliance">Business Lunch | Kenosha Area Business Alliance</a>
        <p class="cyan-publication-date">July 14, 2026 </p>
        <p>Austan Goolsbee, president and CEO of the Federal Reserve Bank of Chicago, participated in a fireside chat at the Kenosha Area Business Alliance Business Lunch event at 12 pm CT on July 14 in Kenosha, Wisconsin. The discussion was moderated by Alliance President Nicole Ryf. </p>
        </div>


<div class="cyan-publication"><a href="/publications/speeches/2026/june-25-chicago-council">Chicago Council on Global Affairs | Global Economy Dialogue Series </a>
        <p class="cyan-publication-date">June 25, 2026 </p>
        <p>Chicago Fed President and CEO Austan Goolsbee participated in a fireside chat at the Chicago Council on Global Affairs Global Economy Dialogue Series event on June 25 in Chicago, Illinois. Brent Neiman, Edward Eagle Brown Professor of Economics at the University of Chicago Booth School of Business, moderated the discussion. </p>
        </div>


<div class="cyan-publication"><a href="/publications/speeches/2026/may-27-bank-of-japan">Bank of Japan Institute for Monetary and Economic Studies Conference 2026
</a>
