    <div class="cyan-publication"><a href="/publications/speeches/2023/oct-4-financial-markets-group-conference">A Conversation with Raghuram G. Rajan</a>
    <p class="cyan-publication-date">October 4, 2023</p>
    
 <p>   Join us virtually on Wednesday, October 4 at 2:00 PM CT for a conversation with Raghuram G. Rajan, the Katherine Dusak Miller Distinguished Service Professor of Finance at the University of Chicago's Booth School, who served as the 23rd Governor of the Reserve Bank of India from 2013 to 2016. President Goolsbee will serve as moderator for the discussion being held at the Chicago Fed's Financial Markets Group Fall Conference.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cyan-publication"><a href="/publications/speeches/2023/oct-4-chicago-payments-symposium">Chicago Payments Symposium </a>
    <p class="cyan-publication-date">October 4, 2023</p>
    
 <p>   Austan D. Goolsbee, president and chief executive officer of the Federal Reserve Bank of Chicago, delivered a speech at the Chicago Payments Symposium on October 4, 2023.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cyan-publication"><a href="/publications/speeches/2023/september-28-peterson-institute">Policy Speech: Peterson Institute for International Economics</a>
    <p class="cyan-publication-date">September 28, 2023</p>
    
    <p>Austan D. Goolsbee, president and chief executive officer of the Federal Reserve Bank of Chicago, delivered a policy speech and participated in a moderated Q&amp;A at the Peterson Institute for International Economics on September 28, 2023.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cyan-publication"><a href="/publications/speeches/2023/sept-7-exploring-career-pathways">Fourth Annual Exploring Career Pathways in Economics and Related Fields Conference</a>
    <p class="cyan-publication-date">September 7, 2023</p>
    
  <p>  Austan D. Goolsbee, president and chief executive officer of the Federal Reserve Bank of Chicago, welcomed participants to the Fourth Annual Exploring Career Pathways in Economics and Related Fields Conference on September 7. The event was designed for Black high school and college students to hear from leaders in economics and related fields about their work and career journeys.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cyan-publication"><a href="/publications/speeches/2023/sept-22-fed-listens">Fed Listens: Joining the Labor Force After Covid &ndash; A Discussion on Youth Employment</a>
    <p class="cyan-publication-date">August 22, 2023</p>
    
<p>    On August 22, Federal Reserve Bank of Chicago President Austan Goolsbee participated in Fed Listens, a discussion on youth employment, with Federal Reserve Governor Michelle Bowman and Midwest leaders in education and workforce development.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cyan-publication"><a href="/publications/speeches/2023/august-1-chicago-business-week">Chicago&rsquo;s Business
    Smart Week</a>
    <p class="cyan-publication-date">August 1, 2023</p>
    
   <p> In recorded remarks, Austan D. Goolsbee, president and chief executive officer of the Federal Reserve Bank of
    Chicago, welcomed participants to ­­­­Chicago&rsquo;s Business Smart Week, a Chicago Fed event designed to provide diverse
    and small businesses with tools and opportunities to grow.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cyan-publication"><a href="/publications/speeches/2023/june-21-wsj-food-forum">
    The Wall Street Journal&rsquo;s Global Food Forum</a>
    <p class="cyan-publication-date">June 21, 2023</p>
    
   <p> A conversation between Austan D. Goolsbee, president and chief executive officer of the Federal Reserve Bank of
    Chicago, and Nick Timiraos, chief economics correspondent at the <em>Wall Street Journal</em>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cyan-publication"><a href="/publications/speeches/2023/may-16-financial-markets-conference">
    Atlanta Fed&rsquo;s Financial Markets Conference</a>
    <p class="cyan-publication-date">May 16, 2023</p>
    
 <p>   A panel featuring Austan D. Goolsbee, president and chief executive officer of the Federal Reserve Bank of Chicago,
    Raphael Bostic, president and chief executive officer, Federal Reserve Bank of Atlanta, and Jeanna Smialek, Federal
    Reserve and economics reporter, <em>The New York Times</em>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cyan-publication">
    <a href="/publications/speeches/2023/april-11-economic-club-chicago">Economic Club of Chicago Forum</a>
    <p class="cyan-publication-date">April 11, 2023</p>
 <p>   
    Austan D. Goolsbee, president and chief executive officer of the Federal Reserve Bank of Chicago, spoke at the
    Economic Club of Chicago Forum Luncheon.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cyan-publication">
    <a href="/publications/speeches/2023/february-28-ivy-tech-community-college">Ivy Tech Community College</a>
    <p class="cyan-publication-date">February 28, 2023</p>
    <p>
    A speech presented by Austan D. Goolsbee, president and chief executive
    officer, Federal Reserve Bank of Chicago, on February 28, 2023, at the
    Garatoni Center for Advance Manufacturing and Automation at an event hosted
    by Ivy Tech Community College in Goshen, IN.
    </p>
    </div></div>
                        


        </div>
    </div>


